Force long long reliability test to pass on gcc 15 (C23 default).
gcc 15 treats functions with empty parameter lists as (void), breaking
GMP configure's ABI detection test.

--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -1 +1 @@
-gmp_prog_cc_works="no, long long reliability test 1"
+gmp_prog_cc_works="yes, long long reliability test 1 (patched)"
